5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm so excited to start! I want to make sure we pick something that actually lasts and helps everyone.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. I suspect we might find the answers we need in the archives if we bother to look.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll be looking for the practical side of things. We can't just dream; we need to know who can actually do the work.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,We should be thorough. I am interested in how the funding is structured to avoid future shortfalls.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I worry about the people who can't get to us. I want to see if they are being left out.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, what do you mean by archives? Are there old projects we should know about?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely, Yumi. It is often more efficient to learn from past failures than to repeat them.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, do you think the budget is the biggest hurdle, or is it the manpower?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Both are linked, Shion. But without a sustainable financial shape, manpower becomes a moot point.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look into the transport links. It feels important.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I want to see if the people in the outer wards are still coming to us.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the records of previous programs and the current equipment spending.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll check the volunteer register and the tool certifications. We need to know our actual capacity.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will look into the grant terms and the equipment lines from last year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll also check the road closures. I wonder if that's why some areas are isolated.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
