34,2,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no, the bus links are gone in two wards! People have to travel an hour now. That's terrible!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,It seems my suspicions were correct. A digitisation project from six years ago was a partial failure.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"We have retired tradespeople volunteering, but no one on staff is actually trained to supervise outside facilitators.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The grant only covers session fees for a year. After that, it hits the flat operating budget.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The roads north of the river close often in winter, but the community halls there stay open.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, if the halls are open but the roads are closed, maybe we should go to them instead of them coming to us?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, did you find anything about the equipment budget? I noticed the vehicle line was overspent last year.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Yumi, going to them sounds nice, but who will staff it? We are already stretched thin.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"Yes, Benjamin. The vehicle line overran by a third, while equipment funds were returned.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think Yumi is right. The attendance at old outreach stops was actually higher than our midweek main branch traffic.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Yumi,,We have to help those people! They are being cut off from everything.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If we choose a digital portal, we risk the same indexing failure as six years ago. It's a logical trap.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"And a Maker Workshop is risky. The tool certification expert retired, and we can't supervise the facilitators.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,"A mobile service would explain the vehicle overspend, but the grant structure makes long-term session fees difficult.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,But the people in the outer wards really need us. It's not fair that they can't reach a counter.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
