60,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"The candidates are a Maker Workshop, Digital Archive, Language Circles, or a Mobile Branch. I vote Mobile Branch!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The Mobile Branch is a logistical nightmare, but the Digital Archive is a proven failure. I'm torn.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shion,,The Maker Workshop is out due to certification. Language Circles might work if they are partner-run.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Minako,,"The Mobile Branch addresses the access issue, but we must be careful with the vehicle budget.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I really think the Mobile Branch is the only way to reach the people who lost their buses.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Minako, can we fix the budget if we know the problem now? We can't just ignore the outer wards!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, are the Language Circles sustainable? Or do they rely on the same fragile grants Minako mentioned?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,They likely do. But they don't require a certified technician or a vehicle that breaks the budget.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,"The grant terms are a risk for any session-based program, including Language Circles.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for the Mobile Branch. It's the most compassionate choice.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"Please, everyone! Let's choose the Mobile Branch. It's about fairness.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"While I dislike the inefficiency, the data on outreach attendance is too significant to ignore. I'll vote Mobile Branch.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shion,,"I still worry about the staff burden, but the other options are either redundant or technically impossible.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minako,,I agree. The access gap is a factual crisis. I will support the Mobile Branch.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you... thank you all for listening.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Yumi,,Yay! I'm so happy we're doing this!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let us hope the vehicle maintenance is handled more rationally this time.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,"I'll vote for the Mobile Branch as well, simply because it's the only one that solves a primary problem.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Minako,,It is decided then.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
